<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/signup.css">
</head>
<body class="signup-body">

  <main class="sg-page">

    <!-- ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <header class="sg-hero">
      <a href="https://www.meibostouch.com/the-creatives-garden"
         target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sg-logo-link"
         aria-label="The Creative's Garden — visit the course page on meibostouch.com">
        <img src="/images/brand/The Creative's Garden Icon with Text_1.svg"
             alt="The Creative's Garden" class="sg-logo">
      </a>
      <p class="sg-eyebrow">Join the free 3-week challenge</p>
      <h1 class="sg-hero-title">Grow in private.<br>Bloom when you're ready.</h1>
      <p class="sg-hero-sub">
        The Creative's Garden is a content creation course for creatives who want
        to share their work online — but freeze, overthink, or burn out trying.
        It starts with a three-week challenge to show up in front of a camera once
        every day for three weeks.
      </p>
      <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-primary sg-hero-cta">Join now →</a>
      <p class="sg-signin-line">
        Already have an account?
        <a href="/<%= returnTo ? '?returnTo=' + encodeURIComponent(returnTo) : '' %>" class="sg-link">Sign in</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- ── This is for you if ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sg-section">
      <h2 class="sg-section-title">This is for you if…</h2>
      <ul class="sg-list">
        <li>You post in anxious bursts, go quiet for weeks, then feel guilty about the silence.</li>
        <li>You have plenty of ideas. Until it's time to share, that is. Then, your mind goes blank.</li>
        <li>You can hype up everyone else's work, but freeze the second it's your own.</li>
        <li>You're worn out from performing for the algorithm, and want your creation practice to feel like it's yours.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sg-note">
        If that sounds familiar, it's not a discipline problem. When being seen
        doesn't feel safe, showing up consistently is hard. So here, in the Garden,
        we'll start somewhere gentler.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ── How the free weeks work ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sg-section sg-section--tinted">
      <p class="sg-eyebrow sg-eyebrow--sage">What does it entail?</p>
      <h2 class="sg-section-title">How the three-week challenge works</h2>
      <p class="sg-body">
        It begins with one small ritual: a daily private video recording — just
        you, talking to the camera.
      </p>
      <p class="sg-body">
        Come as you are; Pajamas and fancy outfits welcome alike. Nobody watches
        these but you (and even that's optional).
      </p>
      <ul class="sg-checklist">
        <li>Record 3–5 minutes daily</li>
        <li>Then, log your recording in the online platform</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sg-body">
        That's the whole practice: three weeks of showing up to a conversation with
        yourself with curiosity, to see what unblocks.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ── What's included, free ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sg-section">
      <h2 class="sg-section-title">What's included, free</h2>
      <div class="sg-grid">
        <div class="sg-card">
          <h3 class="sg-card-title">Three weeks of guided practice</h3>
          <p>Pre-recorded lessons, so you always have a next step and can move at your own pace.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sg-card">
          <h3 class="sg-card-title">Your own private platform</h3>
          <p>A personal login with optional daily prompts, where you log each recording and watch what shifts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sg-card">
          <h3 class="sg-card-title">A group Discord</h3>
          <p>Grow alongside other creatives who know exactly what it's like to struggle to show up online.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sg-card">
          <h3 class="sg-card-title">Seed Packets</h3>
          <p>A free resource to map out your curiosities and get clear on what's genuinely yours to say.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Signup form ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sg-section sg-signup" id="signup">
      <div class="sg-form-card">
        <h2 class="sg-form-title">Join the three-week challenge</h2>

        <% if (error) { %>
          <div class="sg-error" role="alert"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>

        <form action="/signup" method="POST" class="sg-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="name" class="form-label">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" class="form-input"
                   placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name"
                   value="<%= name %>" required>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email" class="form-label">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" class="form-input"
                   placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email"
                   value="<%= email %>" required>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="password" class="form-label">Password</label>
            <input type="password" id="password" name="password" class="form-input"
                   placeholder="At least 8 characters" autocomplete="new-password" required>
            <p class="sg-help">Minimum 8 characters. Include a number or symbol.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Timezone detected client-side; server falls back to America/Denver. -->
          <input type="hidden" id="timezone" name="timezone" value="">
          <% if (returnTo) { %>
            <input type="hidden" name="returnTo" value="<%= returnTo %>">
          <% } %>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-full">Start the free 3 weeks →</button>
        </form>

        <p class="sg-signin-line">
          Already have an account?
          <a href="/<%= returnTo ? '?returnTo=' + encodeURIComponent(returnTo) : '' %>" class="sg-link">Sign in</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── After the challenge: the full course ─────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sg-section">
      <p class="sg-eyebrow sg-eyebrow--sage">After Winter</p>
      <h2 class="sg-section-title">Where it can grow from here</h2>
      <p class="sg-body">
        The free three weeks are <strong>Winter</strong> — the first season of a full
        12-week journey through Spring, Summer, and Fall. Each season moves you a little
        closer to sharing: from recording privately, to watching yourself back, to editing,
        to finally sharing from overflow. You can continue into the full course whenever
        you're ready (it starts at $397) — but there's no pressure. Winter stands on its own.
      </p>
      <p class="sg-note">
        A note of honesty: this is the very first cohort of The Creative's Garden. You'd
        be one of the first people ever to walk through it, which means your feedback will
        shape what it becomes — less a polished product, more a collaboration.
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer class="sg-footer">
      A content creation course by
      <a href="https://www.meibostouch.com/the-creatives-garden" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sg-link">The Meibos Touch</a>.
    </footer>

  </main>

  <script>
    // Pass the user's IANA timezone so their course_start_date matches their
    // wall clock. Server falls back to America/Denver if empty/unrecognized.
    try {
      const tz = Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone;
      if (tz) document.getElementById('timezone').value = tz;
    } catch (_) { /* no-op — server fallback handles it */ }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
